n the Marshal Service  most-wanted list  along with photos of what they  might look like today I was awakened by  the siren at the time of the escape  Joleen Babiak was living on Alcatraz her  father was acting warden I can see why  the the FBI would consider it  inconclusive because there's no leads  here that you can go further with the  letter makes an offer if you announce on  TV that I will be promised to go to jail  for no more than a year and get medical  attention I will write back to let you  know exactly where I am  it adds I am 83 years old and in bad  shape I have cancer for him to you know  say that he had cancer and was dying I  feel like you know they should have at  least reached out to the family and let  them know that the letter existed if the  three did survive these treacherous  waters as the letters claimed they would  have outlived the prison Alcatraz closed  in 1963 the year after the escape but  the mystery remains open Nora  John thank you so much
 

